Z||000000||jerpro||11-21-2000||08:04 AM||||Las night i was heading home and when I depressed the accelerator the car would not respond. It would only respond when I gently derpessed it. But everytime I pushed it more than a 1/3 down the car would gust sit there waiting for something and whenever I let go of the accelerator (in the process) the car would rev up slightly. What could b the problem? <P>------------------<BR>Only try your best, and if you don't succeed... TRY HARDER.||||reg||8
